{"id":"084c52a515723288","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbuniq.md","title":"Uniqueness of multilinear coefficients","display":"thm-pbuniq — Uniqueness of multilinear coefficients","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbuniq","aliases":["27-thm-pbuniq"],"display":"thm-pbuniq — Uniqueness of multilinear coefficients","depends_on":["[[27-df-pseudobool]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.2","source_statement":"Theorem 13.1 uniqueness proof","source_printed_pages":"571","source_pdf_pages":"595","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbuniq"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbuniq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbuniq — Uniqueness of multilinear coefficients"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Theorem 13.1 uniqueness proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"571"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"595"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(c,d:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^n\">\\(\\mathbb B^n\\)</span> 和实数值函数空间（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a>）。空积取 1。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\sum_{S\\subseteq N}c(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i=\\sum_{S\\subseteq N}d(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i\\right)\\right)\\Rightarrow\\forall S\\subseteq N\\;(c(S)=d(S)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\sum_{S\\subseteq N}c(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i=\\sum_{S\\subseteq N}d(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i\\right)\\right)\\Rightarrow\\forall S\\subseteq N\\;(c(S)=d(S)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 13.1 唯一性证明已核对：若存在系数差异，取基数最小的差异集合 S；在 χ_S 上求值，所有真子集系数相同，而非 S 子集的单项式为零，于是函数值差恰为 c(S)−d(S)，矛盾。补齐了旧 Hypothesis 中未绑定的 [n]。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pseudobool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$c,d:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R$。$\\mathbb B^n$ 和实数值函数空间（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]）。空积取 1。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"c,d:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\sum_{S\\subseteq N}c(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i=\\sum_{S\\subseteq N}d(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}x_i\\right)\\right)\\Rightarrow\\forall S\\subseteq N\\;(c(S)=d(S)).","display":true}],"bytes":1452,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-505","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbuniq|thm-pbuniq — Uniqueness of multilinear coefficients]]"}],"outgoing":["04a7d534f0d6e0dd"]}